#### One Frame Tower: 
Ideal for beginners or small spaces. Perfect for 1-2 produce types (e.g., herbs or microgreens), yielding ~2-5kg/year. Height: 500mm.

#### Two Frame Tower: 
Supports hybrid setups (e.g., vegetables and small fish like tilapia), yielding ~5-10kg/year. Height: 1000mm.

#### Four Frame Tower: 
Maximizes yield in minimal space, enabling full ecosystems (e.g., aquaponics with mushrooms, snails, and greens), yielding ~10-20kg/year. Height: 2000mm.

